{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13205050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13205050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1320505001:1":{"text":"ありがとう、君たちが見つけてくれたのか！","source_cn":"女神在上，感谢你们把这只羊送回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E91FDA09045C56C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320505002:1":{"text":"放牧中に逃げ出してしまったんだよ。どれだけ呼んでも戻ってこなくて……それにサーシャという名の牧羊犬も飼ってるんだが、彼女も羊を追いかけていったきり……","source_cn":"我刚才正打算回家呢，可没想到今天带出来的几只羊全都跑远...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3679619733018A52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320505003:1":{"text":"私の脚力では探し回るのも困難で、ここでサーシャが連れ戻してくれるのを待つしかなかった。","source_cn":"但我腿脚不方便，根本追不上它们，只能在这里等萨莎把它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC0C899243A599C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320505004:1":{"text":"でも、君たちはどこでこの子を見つけたんだ？他に羊はいなかった？","source_cn":"你们是在哪找到这只羊的？那附近还有没有别的羊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20EF4A257C445A53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1320505004":{"text":"でも、君たちはどこでこの子を見つけたんだ？他に羊はいなかった？","source_cn":"你们是在哪找到这只羊的？那附近还有没有别的羊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20EF4A257C445A53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320505005:1":{"text":"ワンちゃんが誘導してきたんです。きっとあれがサーシャさんだったんですよ！","source_cn":"是一只狗把它赶到我们身边的。应该就是你说的萨莎吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD529C3715C3BB9E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320505007:1":{"text":"うん、間違いない！うちのサーシャは優秀で、常に群れを監視してるからね。","source_cn":"噢，那肯定没错！我的萨莎很听话，会一直跟在羊群身边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16FA1540D541D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320505008:1":{"text":"この子を君たちに任せて、他の二匹を探してるんだろう。","source_cn":"既然它没跟着你们回来，估计是去找另外两只羊了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F8638A5806927B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320505009:1":{"text":"そういえばさっき、<style=\"highlight\">北の方</style>から羊の鳴き声が聞こえた気がしたんだ。私の代わりに確かめてきてくれないか？","source_cn":"对了，我刚才听到<style=highlight>北边...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF354C10618F4B61A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320505010:1":{"text":"分かりました！見つけたら必ず連れ戻しますね！","source_cn":"那好吧，我们会去看看的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x014F53A863165EC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"